concept:c2005a00024-sch-1-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Paragraph 95(1)(b)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (b) either: (i) is provided by a person under a contract with the Commonwealth; or (ii) is provided by 2 or more persons under contracts with the Commonwealth (with each of the persons providing a part of the service)." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (b) either: (i) is provided by a person under a contract with the Commonwealth; or (ii) is provided by 2 or more persons under contracts with the Commonwealth (with each of the persons providing a part of the service)."@en ;
