    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute: (2) Each NRS contract must provide for the relevant NRS provider to prepare service plans for so much of the NRS as is covered by the contract. The service plan must include at least the following matters: (a) timetables for the supply of so much of the NRS as is covered by the contract;  Amendments relating to the National Relay Service Schedule 1 Amendments commencing on Royal Assent Part 1 Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment (National Relay (b) performance standards to be met by the NRS provider." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute: (2) Each NRS contract must provide for the relevant NRS provider to prepare service plans for so much of the NRS as is covered by the contract. The service plan must include at least the following matters: (a) timetables for the supply of so much of the NRS as is covered by the contract;  Amendments relating to the National Relay Service Schedule 1 Amendments commencing on Royal Assent Part 1 Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment (National Relay (b) performance standards to be met by the NRS provider."@en ;
